Subject: CP-T1.8 a follower drops a peer's read instead of passing it on under the peer's name
Why: A peer's ReadIndex reaches a follower only when the peer took it for the leader (it lost the lead since); passed on, the read reaches the new leader from the follower under the peer's name, which Amphora's authenticated sender check refuses (lane W4, the nemesis test's 1 in 16). Dropped, the peer's owner asks again as it does when its read is lost

